Date: Sat, 7 Nov 2026 13:21:51 -0800
Subject: [PATCH 6/7] S6: usage status resource

LimitEnforcer.snapshot() and MCPServer.enable_limits_resource(): a static
limits_status resource whose JSON report MCPServer.read_resource() builds at
read time for the calling session.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
